WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.770
OpenAI replies with the named plan.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:13.492
Keep completed text in application memory.

00:00:13.492 --> 00:00:16.454
Clear actual SDK messages. No request.

00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:19.360
Restore text with fresh SDK message IDs.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.220
Restored text alone cannot be saved.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:30.614
A new OpenAI request remembers Lighthouse.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:48.184
Replay is read-only. No requests or writes.

00:00:48.184 --> 00:00:55.400
Back live.
